    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32214" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκοκκίζω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιῶ</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Lys.</u>
			364
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take out
				kernels</i> or <i>seeds,</i> e.g. from pomegranates, <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.649
			</span></i> : hence metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσίδιον..ἐξεκόκκισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.Com.
					3
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. σφυρόν</span>
			<i>put out</i> one's ankle, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1179
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰς τρίχας</span>
			<i>pluck out</i> the hair, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				448
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸ γῆρας</span>
			<i>drive away</i> old age, ib.<i><span class="en">
				364
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰς πόλεις</span>
			<i>sack, gut</i> the cities, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pax</u>
				63
			</span></i>.</div>
